    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u2728\ud83d\udd0d  mystical detective furry visual novel  \ud83d\udc7b\u2728</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/e6133ab410f52294caa536562a4dc62b.poster.avif?t=1754985900\" width=622 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/e6133ab410f52294caa536562a4dc62b.webm?t=1754985900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/e2956853ae977b7cb50c67b318c708bb.avif?t=1754985900\" width=615 height=294 /></span><br><br>Our love for fairytales can stay with us for years and years. We're here to show you that adults love them too. And love them passionately. Or should we say \u2014 love the more... passionate fairytales?<br>Here come the spicy readings of famous stories with lascivious beauties, princes, dwarves, giants and witches... Everyone you've been waiting for is here for you!<br><br>What if the Little Mermaid gets more from the sea witch than just... legs? What if Rapunzel discovers the hidden potential of her hair? Hansel and Gretel are long past being kids, and they're ready to defeat the witch in a different way. And speaking of the Red Riding Hood and the Wolf... Those two can definitely come to a mutually beneficial agreement.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/da9e52e72525354c2a927d1cd588af8a.webp?t=1754985900\" width=615 height=50 /></span><br>In these series you can pick a character who suits you more \u2764\ufe0f<br>What would you prefer?<br>A hot classic? \ud83c\udf46\ud83c\udf51<br>Steamy manly embraces? \ud83c\udf46\ud83c\udf46<br>Tender feminine care? \ud83c\udf51\ud83c\udf51<br>Our all at once? \ud83d\udc40<br>This time we intend to satisfy every request! \u2764\ufe0f<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/da9e52e72525354c2a927d1cd588af8a.webp?t=1754985900\" width=615 height=50 /></span><br>There are many retellings of old fairytales, and we want to share our own recipe \u2014 perfectly spiced, peppery, and certainly very furry!<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 Several fairytail stories where you can choose your character\u2019s gender!<br>\u2022 Original illustrations<br>\u2022 Longer animated sex scenes with sound effects and voiceover<br>\u2022 Branching narrative, hard choices, sloppy rewards [/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Updated Match-3 gameplay with new goals and features<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/015c7f3aa10e78173b7d2cfc174ff77b.webp?t=1754985900\" width=612 height=41 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/8b82fbd9a2e454d0fcbcb7a11124c82d.webp?t=1754985900\" width=612 height=41 /></span></p>",
