r character\u2019s gender!<br>\u2022 Original illustrations<br>\u2022 Longer animated sex scenes with sound effects and voiceover<br>\u2022 Branching narrative, hard choices, sloppy rewards [/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Updated Match-3 gameplay with new goals and features<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/015c7f3aa10e78173b7d2cfc174ff77b.webp?t=1754985900\" width=612 height=41 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953140/extras/8b82fbd9a2e454d0fcbcb7a11124c82d.webp?t=1754985900\" width=612 height=41 /></span></p>",
